  <h2 data-i="about_h">From your first line to the front door.</h2>
  <div>
   <p data-i="about_p1">VEL BUILDERS is a building design and construction company in Pudukkottai, Tamil Nadu. We help you plan your home, find your way through the approval process, and build it with care.</p>
   <p data-i="about_p2">Every project starts with a conversation about your plot and what you need. Er. S. Karna and the team will take it from there.</p>
