   <p class="eyebrow" data-i="founder_role">Founder of VEL BUILDERS</p>
   <h2 data-i="founder_h">The Vision Behind Every Home</h2>
   <p data-i="founder_p1">Er. S. Karna is the founder of VEL BUILDERS. His vision is to help people turn the idea of a home into a thoughtful, well-planned building project. He believes a home is more than a structure: it is shaped around the needs, hopes, and everyday life of the people who live in it.</p>
   <p data-i="founder_p2">That vision guides VEL BUILDERS’ work in building plans, plan approval guidance, construction, and contract work. Each project starts by listening—understanding the client’s needs, discussing the possibilities, and helping them take the next steps with clarity.</p>
   <p data-i="founder_p3">For Er. S. Karna, careful planning is essential to building with purpose. By bringing planning and construction services together, VEL BUILDERS aims to make the process easier to understand and more personal for each client. His vision continues to guide the company: to help create homes that feel considered, practical, and personal to the people who will live in them.</p>
